", "id": "1148192932456664", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974625_1148192935789997_1416656799652225989_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ygTjc-DRMmoQ7kNvwEpuh2E&_nc_oc=Adq7j7yCWTf5dxA-YcNWnKha_rI6U3j9Q64LEEcvD8Tt2I092kQJR0vHV3DBhWpM94I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0sTw4URLfd_s3cxF3PxOtQ75CHXWnr_3frsKt4gcIabA&oe=69E62D36"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-2.png", "id": "2332569856899945", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_2332569860233278_8835659424562109361_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oOcksh4MuUEQ7kNvwExd0rp&_nc_oc=AdqtN2j-EhXjUhw41nTCQAW6njPvueouZxIZSV8KzphpnGrs1e9_hDqKIpdtwl3SjqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af29kwXvV2gataqpfGTcCX0u0EHqJvJC22GdD9e4knoODA&oe=69E63CF6"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-5.png", "id": "430728135872291", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003247_430728139205624_5946641524650245644_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-qOJ_tiC2YgQ7kNvwH5k4mz&_nc_oc=Adq4Rw45S6Esd9ap5kO_VxDbtdyUPtxQdX4By0gvnrNUxdW992UQtqaw7eMK1Gj-X9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1tqwHIlWYBw0TLkoO4QgDIRzUEUgo_T4W8kcfPRlSFOw&oe=69E63F22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videoscreen.png", "id": "986130542781323", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974594_986130546114656_4585000279316381076_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IQHOJJ9D_KIQ7kNvwF5w1Cx&_nc_oc=AdqoaThEMcFMBU9sX877JwAIBRC28LQfCMSub7HlsUpvwjA78Prq-RLxFom3Qmni1UI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2ddcKLvwqkeKPJrW8ti58yamM7HxQVvDvT08lMYP9imQ&oe=69E630AE"}, "display_name": "Paradiddle", "keywords": ["drum", "beat", "music", "piano", "instrument"], "long_description": "So much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!\n\nKey Features:\n- Flex your skills in the built-in rhythm game mode: adjustable difficulty for 30 different songs, plus custom song support and cross-platform leaderboards.\n- Create your custom drum kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments, from mallet instruments like the xylophone and steel drum, to auxiliary percussion such as bongos, tambourines and timpanis.\n- Pick up the basics with 10 beginner-friendly lessons, perfect for drumming newcomers.\n- Use the new multiplayer mode to perform for your friends in free play, or compete to get the high score playing the built-in songs.\n- MR passthrough support empowers you to play virtual drums in the real world. You can even connect and augment your physical kit with the rhythm game mode and lessons.\n- MIDI input/output support provides a powerful tool for composers, and also lets you augment your own electronic drum kit.\n- Set the mood with 4 different environments: Dojo, Jazz Club, Galaxy, Void.\n- USB and Bluetooth pedal support for kick and hi-hat.\n- Load your own songs, audio files and sheet music.\n- Easily save/load different kits and record your jam sessions.", "short_description": "Play drums without the limitations of the real world.\n\nSo much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emre Tanirgan", "support_website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/faq", "website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/